# Make your own for other topics → Anki workflow with ChatGPT
# This is how I made this one
# Learn prompting with your favorite AI
# ask the AI to teach how to most effectively use it

This repo was built using a repeatable process:
1) Build a short learning sprint
2) Convert it into interview-grade Anki cards

## Starter prompt
You are my MSP interview mentor.
I want a sprint-based lesson on <TOPIC>.
Baseline: CompTIA A+, studying for Network+.

Constraints:
- Windows commands only
- MSP ticket realism
- Explain what to run, what it checks, and why
- Include common pitfalls

Then generate an Anki CSV with:
Front | Back | Tags

Formatting rules:
- Randomize correct answer letters
- Front: question, blank line, choices
- Back: Correct Answer, commands, interpretation